    "solution": "Use the out-spec terminals @ dim 5 for production.\nCurrent spec of dim 5: Up to 0.066 [spec 0.062 – 0.065]\nOnly use terminals from this batch for inserting with COSMO bobbins (No defects on COSMO bobbins; do not use for Sun Electronic bobbins because they will crack after inserting). And 54101-09 terminal uses for the following bobbin list\n70193-00\n80037-06\n80037-07\n80037-08\n80118-00\n80119-00\n55177-05\nWe tried to take 40pcs of the terminal, assemble them to bobbin 70193-00 and 80037-07, then checked the visual inspection and rotate them @7k RPM, measure the length of terminal before and after.\nAfter inserting terminals into bobbins, all samples passed both visual inspections. The length of the terminal before and after insertion was measured as below\nWith 70193-00 bobbin\na. Measure the length of terminal before and after winding\nb. Check stuck at molding: take all samples, it doesn’t get stuck at insert\nWith 80037-07 bobbin\nMeasure the length of terminal before and after winding\nThe length of terminal acceptable. Some value we saw it different that we can adjust the stopper during production to ensure it stays within range.\nConclusion: We can accept these terminals with Cosmo bobbins for production.",
    "actions": "1. Discuss with Team for out-of-spec terminal.\nTake 40pcs of the terminal, assemble them to bobbin 70193-00 and 80037-07, and then pass them through the winding machine for measurement.\n3. Work with ECO vendor to overcome for out-of-spec on dim #5 of 54101-09 in future\n4. Issue DEV",
